OL,3,CPolice chief says public safety is top
OL,4,Cpriority at Brighton Pride
OL,6,FSussex Police and Crime Commissioner
OL,7,FKaty Bourne says police will be
OL,8,Fworking tirelessly this weekend to
OL,9,Fkeep everyone safe at Brighton Pride.
OL,11,FArmed officers will be deployed for
OL,12,Fthe UK's largest Pride festival
OL,13,Ffollowing the attack on Berlin's Pride
OL,14,Fevent on last Saturday (25 July).
OL,16,FMs Bourne said: "Last weekend's events
OL,17,Fhave have been shocking for everyone
OL,18,Fand all sympathies go out to people
OL,19,Fthat were affected by that.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
