FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785514721
OL,3,CPolice chief says public safety is top
OL,4,Cpriority at Brighton Pride
OL,6,F"But as far as policing goes (for
OL,7,FBrighton Pride), the plans have been
OL,8,Fin place for quite some time.
OL,10,F"There's meticulous planning, it goes
OL,11,Fon for many weeks."
OL,13,FShe added: "It's not just Sussex
OL,14,FPolice, but it will be the pride
OL,15,Forganisers, the city council, as well
OL,16,Fas the hospitality sector because at
OL,17,Fthe end of the day, they want everyone
OL,18,Fto have a really good time and be safe.
OL,20,F"It's an amazing event and if you've
OL,21,Fnever been before, please come along.
OL,26,@nD@^pmoD@Opn
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
