OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785514721
OL,3,CPolice chief says public safety is top
OL,4,Cpriority at Brighton Pride
OL,6,F"It is absolutely the jewel in the
OL,7,Fcrown for events in Brighton and Hove,
OL,8,Fand you will be guaranteed a really
OL,9,Fgood time.
OL,11,F"There'll be plenty of police around.
OL,12,FYou'll see officers in hi-viz jackets.
OL,14,F"There'll be officers there in blue
OL,15,Ftabards as well that you can chat to
OL,16,Fand there'll be plainclothes officers
OL,17,Fas well so there'll be a mix there to
OL,18,Fkeep you safe.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
