PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785514721
OL,3,CPolice chief says public safety is top
OL,4,Cpriority at Brighton Pride
OL,6,F"If you're not sure, you can always
OL,7,Fspeak to a police officer or contact
OL,8,Fthe police too."
OL,10,FThe leader of Brighton & Hove City
OL,11,FCouncil, Bella Sankey, said in a post
OL,12,Fon the council's Facebook page: "We
OL,13,Fstand in solidarity with the LGBTQI+
OL,14,Fcommunity and, as we look forward to
OL,15,FBrighton & Hove Pride this weekend, we
OL,16,Fwant to reassure all those attending
OL,17,Fthat we are working closely with
OL,18,FBrighton & Hove Pride, Sussex Police
OL,19,Fand our other partners to keep
OL,20,Feveryone safe.
OL,26,@tD@aOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
